<title>USA: InSight Health sets acquisition.</title>
<headline>InSight Health sets acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>InSight Health Services Corp on Wednesday said it has signed a definitive agreement to acquire Maine's Mobile Imaging Consortium and the Mobile Imaging Consortium -- New Hampshire.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were undisclosed.</p>
<p>The deal adds three health care networks to Insight's existing business in the Northeast. It is subject to certain approvals and other conditions, InSight said in a statement.</p>
<p>Based in Newport Beach, InSight provides diagnostic imaging and information, treatment and related management services.</p>
</text>
